"},{"t":"2）等待 1 秒，机器人说：“输入 2 个数据”2 秒；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20240225/17088693954570.png"},{"t":"3）舞台下方出现询问框，机器人说：“输入第 1 个数据”（数据为整数，且 1≤数据≤100）；"},{"t":"例如：输入 80"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20240225/17088694105197.png"},{"t":"4）完成输入，舞台下方出现询问框，机器人说：“输入第 2 个数据”（数据为整数，且 1≤数据≤100）；"},{"t":"例如：输入 60"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20240225/17088694238915.png"},{"t":"5）完成输入，机器人说出两个数据的和；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20240225/17088694379472.png"},{"t":"6）等待 1 秒，机器人说出两个数据和的二进制数。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20240225/17088694516346.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2023","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}